  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "Wu WeiChen YaHu DaqiangShu Lingling （Department of pharmacyResearch Institute of Field SurgeryDaping Hospitalthe T hird Military Medical U niversityChongqing 400042P．R．China）",
    "bbox": [
