  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "ABSTRACT Objective： T o develop a preparing method and quality control for minoxidil solution．Method： T he content of minoxidil was determined by U V spectrophotometry．Result： Linear relationship was found in the minoxidil concentrations ranging from 2 to $1 0 \\ \\mu _ { \\mathrm { g } } { \\cdot } \\mathrm { m l } ^ { - 1 }$ ．T he average recovery of minoxidil was 99．84％ $R S D = 0 . 3 6 \\% ( n = 9 )$ ．Conclusion： Minoxidil solution is stable simple in preparation technique and accurate in quality control",
    "bbox": [
      13,
      503,
      980,
      576
    ],
    "page_idx": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "KEY WORDS Minoxidil；Solution；Preparation；Quality control",
